WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You notice one event. A second passes unnoticed. That is not a verdict on your intelligence.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Under particular conditions, attention can miss brief changes.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A laboratory result does not prove an audio product will fix this.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A 2023 review of brainwave studies found mixed results.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before purchasing, name one small task and try twelve quiet minutes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Follow the evidence. Read the guide. Or decide not to buy.
